---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Micro-Enterprise Loans in Egypt | Community Transformation Trust" description="Through our partnership with GHNI, CT Trust helps provide micro-enterprise loans to women in need in Egypt, with a 100% repayment rate.">
  <div class="report-banner-wrap">
    <img class="report-banner" src="/images/projects/micro-enterprise-egypt.png" alt="" loading="eager" />
  </div>
  <article class="wrap report-article">
    <h1>Micro-Enterprise Loans in Egypt</h1>
    <div class="detail-meta"><span>2025</span><span>Egypt</span></div>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Small Loans, Big Impact</h3>
      <p>Through our partnership with <a href="https://globalhopenetwork.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GHNI,</a> we are helping to provide micro-enterprise loans to women in need in Egypt. GHNI works with many different communities in Egypt &amp; offers small loans to women to help them increase their income. So far 100% of loans have been repaid.</p>
      <p>These loans are being used for many different income-generation projects:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Sewing and repairing clothes</li>
        <li>Buying products to sell in small shops</li>
        <li>Making cleaning agents</li>
        <li>Making ice-creams and candifloss</li>
        <li>Hair dressing</li>
      </ul>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/projects/micro-enterprise-egypt-1.png" alt="A woman running a business supported by a micro-enterprise loan" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>Donate a Micro-Enterprise Loan:</h3>
      <p>A donation of $340 NZD provides a micro-enterprise loan to a women from a poor community in Egypt (via our partnership with GHNI). When the loan is repaid it will be re-loaned to another women.</p>
      <p>If you would like to donate a micro-enterprise loan please visit our <a href="/donation">Donation Page</a>. All donations are tax-deductible in New Zealand.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>This woman runs a business selling ice-creams, making cleaning agents, and making candyfloss.</h3>
      <p>She has increased her income from these businesses through the support of micro-enterprise loans from GHNI.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/projects/micro-enterprise-egypt-2.png" alt="A woman with her ice-cream and candyfloss business" loading="lazy" />
    </section>

    <section class="reveal">
      <h3>April 2025: Visit to Cairo to see GHNI&rsquo;s projects</h3>
      <p>In April 2025, David and Margaret visited GHNI&rsquo;s projects in Cairo, witnessing firsthand the incredible impact of their work and hearing inspiring stories from women involved in their programs.</p>
      <img class="report-photo" src="/images/projects/micro-enterprise-egypt-3.png" alt="Visiting GHNI's projects in Cairo, April 2025" loading="lazy" />
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
